    "detailed_description": "An adventure in the Age of Caves, where a young man is forced to fight with adversaries and jurastic animals that are<br>under the effect of a spell. Cause of a villain who imprisoned the master sorceress and sucks her energy, to<br>dominate the entire prehistoric planet.<br>His goal is to rescue her and destroy this monster.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >   <strong>Main Features</strong></h2></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Attack your opponents and bosses with multiple ax strikes.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You will be transformed into a pterosaur where you can fly and shoot fireballs at your enemies.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unleash magic, breaking a portal to transform into an aggressive dinosaur and destroy your enemies with powerful headbutts.<br></li><li>Use the ability to jump and attack with the ax for more aggressive attacks.<br></li><li>Attack the last boss by jumping at exact moments and use small blows to hit him and be victorious, to rescue your princess.</li></ul>",
